### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Checkout without discount -> 250
POST http://localhost:3000/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "id": "prod-1", "price": 100, "requestedQuantity": 2 },
    { "id": "prod-2", "price": 50, "requestedQuantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Checkout with a percentage discount -> 225
POST http://localhost:3000/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "id": "prod-1", "price": 100, "requestedQuantity": 2 },
    { "id": "prod-2", "price": 50, "requestedQuantity": 1 }
  ],
  "discountCode": "10PERCENT"
}

### Checkout with a flat discount -> 240
POST http://localhost:3000/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "id": "prod-1", "price": 100, "requestedQuantity": 2 },
    { "id": "prod-2", "price": 50, "requestedQuantity": 1 }
  ],
  "discountCode": "MINUS10"
}

### Insufficient stock -> 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "products": [
    { "id": "prod-3", "price": 10, "requestedQuantity": 1 }
  ]
}
